            "review_title": "Review at Nin Nin Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Queenie\n82 contributions\n0\nFood is good but staff is bad\nMay 2018 • Couples\nThe restaurant is located on 5th floor inside Zen Diamond Suite Hotel. The price is quite expensive compared to other Japanese food in town. The food quality is pretty good, especially the dessert is awesome. I came there a couple of time, but this time we are extremely upset with the staff. They offer the set menu with reasonable price. Signage on the table showed that the set menu included one specific cocktail then we ordered. After she delivered the cocktail and we drank then she just told us that “sorry, I forgot to tell you that the cocktail is no longer included in this set menu. It will be chargeable”. The cocktail cost 200k. If we knew it we might have ordered the different better drink. We felt being treated and will never come back.\nRead more\nWritten May 31, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
