            "review_title": "Review at Nin Nin Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Steve J\n15 contributions\n0\nDelicious Japanese food, great price, good service, English menus\nApr 2018 • Family\nThe restaurant is located on the 5th floor of Zen Diamond Hotel. The food is fresh and delicious. They have lunch set menu under $10.00 and a wide selection of Izakaya style dishes with a great Sake selection. I came here twice during my 1 week stay in DaNang. All the staff speak English very well.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 27, 2018",
