            "review_title": "Review at Nin Nin Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Quan N\nDa Nang, Vietnam176 contributions\n0\nNice Japanese restaurant\nApr 2018 • Friends\nThis restaurant is brand new and we are very pleased with the way they run this business. \n_ The food is amazingly well prepared with fresh ingredients and very tasty. Sushi, sashimi, hot pot and many authentic Japanese food are available here. \n_ There are many private rooms so it's suitable for groups of friends. \n_ Staffs are super friendly and helpful. \n_ The restaurant is on the 5th floor of the hotel but the hotel itself is in the center of the town, easy to find.\n_ A little pricy but it's worthy. \nPlus, it's a new restaurant so there are some nice combos. \nHope they can keep up the good work and highly recommend!\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2018",
